{
  "description": "Shared Note_Key fixture. Both normalizeNoteKey implementations (backend/src/domain/noteKey.js and frontend/src/clarity/quickAdd/noteKey.ts) must return `expected` for `input`. A null `expected` means the text has no Note_Key.",
